  "approvedRevision": "1.0",
  "revisionHistory": [
    {
      "revision": "1.0",
      "summary": "First executable candidate for the parity-first direction: /cart, the cart drawer and the payment step.",
      "rejectedTraits": [
        "DrawerShell built on Modal with placement=right - refused once HeroUI 3.2.4 was found to ship a real Drawer with its own placement, header, handle and edge transitions.",
        "A new installment-cycle-row entry - refused as a duplicate of pricing-phase-row's classes, slots and mark mechanic; merged by freeing that pair of its domain name instead.",
        "A cart-clear-armed state - removed because a static export renders the resting control while the state claims the armed one."
      ]
    }
  ],
  "deliveryMode": "batch",
  "mode": "mixed",
  "parityBaseline": "D:\\Repositories\\starci-academy (mtp, 9a19342) - CartPage, MiniCartDrawer, PaymentModal, CartLine",
  "workItems": [
    "page-cart",
    "overlay-cart-drawer",
    "overlay-checkout",
    "block-cart-line",
    "block-order-summary",
    "shell-drawer",
    "leaf-confirm-button"
  ],
  "evidence": [
    "HeroUI 3.2.4 ships Drawer with Backdrop/Content(placement)/Dialog/Header/Heading/Body/Footer/Handle/CloseTrigger.",
    "ModalShell hardcodes placement=center and exposes no placement prop, so a side panel cannot be reached through it.",
    "props-and-slots SLOTS-4 names ModalShell, DrawerShell and DropdownShell as the only components that may expose children.",
    "pricing-phase-ladder/-row already own the ordered-steps-with-one-current relationship; their classes, three slots and mark mechanic match an instalment schedule exactly.",
    "stacked-stat-rows is already the money reckoning but holds stat-row, which requires an icon; a subtotal has no honest glyph.",
    "The legacy cart clears the basket behind an inline two-step confirm, commented 'canon: destructive action needs confirmation'.",
    "At 375px the page reports scrollWidth === clientWidth === 375 with zero overflowing nodes and the cover at display:none.",
    "add-to-cart shipped into CourseCatalogCard between the Plan lock and the Preview lock, so AddToCartButton is not a new owner."
  ],
  "unknowns": [
    "The armed state of ConfirmButton has not been observed: react-aria onPress ignores a synthetic click and the browser pane is hidden, so a real pointer press timed out.",
    "The light theme was screenshotted but its token inversion has not been read node by node.",
    "Focus return after the drawer dismisses is the vendor's and no state exercises the keyboard."
  ],
  "decisions": [
    "Instalments stay a deliberate choice at the payment step; the cart states the pay-in-full price and one hint naming the FIRST payment rather than a per-month figure.",
    "The clear-all control lives on the page only. The drawer is the quick look and should not hold the most destructive act.",
    "The narrow render is recorded as measured rather than photographed, because the screenshot pipeline lays out wider than its window and crops."
  ],
